{"summary":"Survival RPG: Open World Pixel is a 2D retro epic adventure and action game.","description":"Survival RPG: Open World Pixel is a free retro 2D pixel RPG game taking place in a medieval retro style open world. In this epic retro 2D game, your quest is to survive, explore the lands and islands, craft houses, tools, and armors, mine and explore dungeons and castles, find treasures and fight monsters (dragons, dinosaurs, and many other monsters) in a fantasy medieval open world. Survival RPG: Open World Pixel lets you choose between a mountain world, an island world or both. From the same retro 2D pixel world of the Survival RPG game series, a new game of action, adventure, and survival begins! \n\n<b>Features :</b>\n- Explore islands, dungeons, medieval castles, and more\n- Discover hidden objects and treasures \n- Mine precious metals inside dungeons to help you craft houses, armors, and tools\n- Fight dragons, dinosaurs, and other monsters \n- Unlock crafting recipes during your epic adventure\n- Discover this survival RPG game set in a 2d retro world\n- Play a free offline action and adventure game\n\nEnjoy Survival RPG: Open World Pixel, a free retro 2D pixel RPG game full of action, adventure, and survival!","esrbNotes":"Mild Fantasy Violence","pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $19.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8SLYVW3XkFk?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wWrnKfeAz0B7wttVJHHCj8HmSK_iJtKxw0NK8_ZZDWkyn9JZce02pwqJUOpC3pwxfZdrzvD7UC6IKJerB4zo","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/P9OXl51ngroj0afhM03tkXKEmWu8N8VtvX9cjbtakIiIvyF6XJ65OfUW4RWzU0desqMpmqXI8aoTFA1GpkBhsQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hCQJf5QIAA5jiBynrz4Achjw0fAQ38YWyX9qTf18cgxw-Pln5q661RDVHacUYmgVfkFJOh1S5JGnMACK7tBX","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ZfmVMT56ebWYhLlSLiAcD50eq5D5pD-S-1yI1obsH7YNt7uW8_QQlDiTkPQn9vYp8S1epdD5xLXt7cAGGPUH","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8HMotaKULnXpI